          "speaker": "Behrouz"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "And when a verse says that after, if you die before age of 40, you go to Heaven, that's it.",
      "start": 340.85,
      "end": 349.89,
      "speaker": "Behrouz",
      "words": [
