          "end": 5282.45,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " by",
          "start": 5282.45,
          "end": 5282.45,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " what",
          "start": 5282.45,
          "end": 5282.45,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " God",
          "start": 5282.45,
          "end": 5282.45,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " said.",
          "start": 5282.45,
          "end": 5282.45,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "If God said He sent the angels to turn it upside down, I can't say that God can sit up there and say \"be\", and it is upside down.",
