          "end": 5282.45,
          "speaker": "Behrouz"
        },
        {
          "word": " nothing.\"",
          "start": 5282.45,
          "end": 5282.45,
          "speaker": "Behrouz"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "And I said \"so if something created from nothing, that must be nothing.\" That was your reason.",
      "start": 5282.45,
      "end": 5282.45,
      "speaker": "Behrouz",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " And",
          "start": 5282.45,
          "end": 5282.45,
          "speaker": "Behrouz"
        },
        {
          "word": " I",
          "start": 5282.45,
          "end": 5282.45,
          "speaker": "Behrouz"
        },
        {
          "word": " said",
          "start": 5282.45,
          "end": 5282.45,
          "speaker": "Behrouz"
        },
        {
          "word": " \"so",
