          "word": " right.",
          "start": 5282.45,
          "end": 5282.45,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Believe me, I call you Rashad, Dr. Khalifa, before, before this Khutba, I didn't know anything about what has happened.",
