          "speaker": "Ali"
        },
        {
          "word": " up.",
          "start": 5282.45,
          "end": 5282.45,
          "speaker": "Ali"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He brought it up in front of all of us. Dr. Khalifa: Yes.",
      "start": 5282.45,
      "end": 5282.45,
      "speaker": "Ali",
