          "speaker": "Ali"
        },
        {
          "word": " Dr.",
          "start": 5282.45,
          "end": 5282.45,
          "speaker": "Ali"
        },
        {
          "word": " Khalifa:",
          "start": 5282.45,
          "end": 5282.45,
          "speaker": "Ali"
        },
        {
          "word": " Well...",
          "start": 5282.45,
          "end": 5282.45,
          "speaker": "Ali"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "No, I'm just saying.",
      "start": 5282.45,
      "end": 5282.45,
      "speaker": "Ali",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " No,",
          "start": 5282.45,
          "end": 5282.45,
          "speaker": "Ali"
        },
        {
          "word": " I'm",
          "start": 5282.45,
          "end": 5282.45,
          "speaker": "Ali"
        },
        {
          "word": " just",
          "start": 5282.45,
          "end": 5282.45,
          "speaker": "Ali"
        },
        {
          "word": " saying.",
          "start": 5282.45,
          "end": 5282.45,
          "speaker": "Ali"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He said there was something. He thought there was something wrong.",
      "start": 5282.45,
      "end": 5282.45,
      "speaker": "Ali",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " He",
          "start": 5282.45,
          "end": 5282.45,
          "speaker": "Ali"
        },
        {
          "word": " said",
          "start": 5282.45,
          "end": 5282.45,
          "speaker": "Ali"
        },
        {
          "word": " there",
          "start": 5282.45,
          "end": 5282.45,
          "speaker": "Ali"
        },
        {
          "word": " was",
          "start": 5282.45,
          "end": 5282.45,
          "speaker": "Ali"
        },
        {
          "word": " something.",
          "start": 5282.45,
          "end": 5282.45,
          "speaker": "Ali"
        },
        {
          "word": " He",
          "start": 5282.45,
          "end": 5282.45,
          "speaker": "Ali"
        },
        {
          "word": " thought",
          "start": 5282.45,
          "end": 5282.45,
          "speaker": "Ali"
        },
        {
          "word": " there",
          "start": 5282.45,
          "end": 5282.45,
          "speaker": "Ali"
        },
        {
          "word": " was",
          "start": 5282.45,
          "end": 5282.45,
          "speaker": "Ali"
        },
        {
          "word": " something",
          "start": 5282.45,
          "end": 5282.45,
          "speaker": "Ali"
        },
        {
          "word": " wrong.",
          "start": 5282.45,
          "end": 5282.45,
          "speaker": "Ali"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "I don't even know what it's about. But he thought there was something wrong.",
