          "word": " sides.",
          "start": 5282.45,
          "end": 5282.45,
          "speaker": "Ali"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "And he got up and he talked. And I think about courage to talk in front of people. Then, all of a sudden, all you people",
