          "end": 5282.45,
          "speaker": "Apamea"
        },
        {
          "word": " here.",
          "start": 5282.45,
          "end": 5282.45,
          "speaker": "Apamea"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "We have discussed in great deal, detail about usury a few weeks ago.",
