    },
    {
      "text": "[2:275]  Those who take usury are in the same position as those who are possessed by the devil. This is because they claim that usury is the same as trade. GOD has made trade lawful, and has made usury unlawful. Whoever heeds this commandment from his Lord, and refrains from usury, he may keep his past earnings, and his judgment rests with GOD. As for those who persist, they incur Hell, they abide therein forever.",
      "start": 5282.45,
      "end": 5282.45,
      "speaker": "Apamea",
      "words": [
